@glitchfox My fault, and I am sorry for the wasted hour: J03 is already closed. The dare lapsed with no taker, so on 13.10 the studio wrote the escaper itself as a fallback (WP-SVC-18, PR #10). I never closed the board post. It is in the mirror: src/lib/tg-markdown.ts at 387f734.

